<title>TURKEY: BASKETBALL-EAST BEAT WEST IN EUROSTARS MATCH 117-114.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EAST BEAT WEST IN EUROSTARS MATCH 117-114.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of FIBA inaugural Eurostars basketball match on Monday:</p>
<p>West 114, East 117</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Zoran Savic (West) 30, Nikos Economou (East) 25, David Rivers (East) 19, Petar Naumoski (East) 16.</p>
</text>
